@startuml PasswordStateMachine
title Complex Password Detector State Diagram

state "Collecting" as Collecting
state "Validating" as Validating
state "Accept" as Accept
state "Reject" as Reject

[*] --> Collecting

Collecting --> Collecting : [token] / progress stored in state
Collecting --> Validating : [len >= 8]
Validating --> Validating : [token] / progress stored in state

Collecting --> Reject : [end]
Validating --> Accept : [end and len>=8 and seenUpper and seenSpecial and not lastWasSpecial]
Validating --> Reject : [end and not(len>=8 and seenUpper and seenSpecial and not lastWasSpecial)]

Accept --> [*]
Reject --> [*]

note right of Collecting
Length, uppercase, special-character, and trailing-special progress live in the state objects.
end note
@enduml
